	<Item Name="title" Type="String">Transcriptome analysis to UHRF1 depletion in RaeL cells</Item>
	<Item Name="summary" Type="String">RNAseq was used to identify host and viral transcriptome changes in UHRF1 knock-out RaeL cells. UHRF1 KO RaeL cells were subjected to FACSort for ICAM1+ subpopulations, which were further used for RNAseq analysis. The RaeL cells expressing control sgRNA was used as the control.</Item>
